'''Candy Swirl''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of a smooth red and white candy swirl texture, hence the name. The guard and handle are deep red in color, but the handle features dark indents on it with small pieces of candy around them.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Candy Swirl (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Candy_Swirl_Set Candy Swirl Set].

